        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LVG100003SBRT, 3 Inch Livingston Wooden Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Livingston Wood Fashion Furniture Pull is the perfect addition to all of your modern furniture pieces. Sometimes dressers come with the most boring knobs, but now you can make sure that they suit your style. This knob is available in <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"> different types of wood</a> and the brass mount comes in even more finish choices. We like to pair the dark mahogany wood with sliver satin nickel mounts for a contemporary look. This pull can also be used on kitchen cabinets or in the bathroom (Teak is especially well-suited for damp conditions). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LVG03-specifications.gif?v=1704354513\" width=\"471\" height=\"206\" border=\"0\" alt=\"FII-LVG100003SBRT Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/1-inch-diameter-wooden-appliance-handle-first-impressions-ap-lvg100sbr\"><b>1 Inch Diameter Wooden Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Livingston Wood Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LVG03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262328\"><b>First Impressions LVG100003SBRT Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Livingston Wood Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "The Livingston Wood Fashion Furniture Pull is the perfect addition to all of your modern furniture pieces. Sometimes dressers come with the most boring knobs, but now you can make sure that they suit your style. This knob is available in different types of wood and the brass mount comes in even more finish choices. This pull can also be used on kitchen cabinets or in the bathroom. \r\n\r\n",
